# Ratification is a human action (ADR-006). This file names which humans, per
# path. Tool involvement is never a byline.
#
# This file has no effect until "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled on
# a branch protection ruleset, and GitHub reads CODEOWNERS from the PR's BASE
# branch — so it does nothing until it is on main.
#
# Last match wins, and ownership does not accumulate: a later, narrower rule
# REPLACES the owners of an earlier one rather than adding to them.
#
# Owners are carried from qm's own CODEOWNERS. Confirm the set is right for
# golfVs at spawn: this repository did not exist when that list was written.

*                       @subcontrabass @mrharpo @CameronRWest @MJWKagstrom

# The two surfaces ADR-006 names explicitly. docs/ is the plan of record and
# the ADR log; core/ is the deterministic simulation everything else replays
# against (DESIGN.md §6.1).
/docs/                  @subcontrabass @mrharpo
/core/                  @subcontrabass @mrharpo

# Determinism is load-bearing for records, forks and every async mode
# (DESIGN.md §11). These three carry the same weight as core/.
/records/               @subcontrabass @mrharpo
/async/                 @subcontrabass @mrharpo
/replay/                @subcontrabass @mrharpo

# Enforcement: a PR must not weaken the checks that gate it.
/.github/workflows/     @subcontrabass @mrharpo
/CODEOWNERS             @subcontrabass @mrharpo
/tools/                 @subcontrabass @mrharpo

# Licensing: the outbound grant and the texts it refers to.
/LICENSE                @subcontrabass @mrharpo
/NOTICE                 @subcontrabass @mrharpo
/art/LICENSE            @subcontrabass @mrharpo
/audio/LICENSE          @subcontrabass @mrharpo

# The engine pin. Changing it is an ADR (ADR-008), not a bump.
/.godot-version         @subcontrabass @mrharpo
